---
// Real rows from `go tool pprof -top` on the Todo service CPU profile (Go 1.27.1, 2,460 ms of samples).
const W = 900;
const H = 276;
const S = 4; // px per percent
const rows = [
  ['net/http.(*conn).serve', 0, 63.01],
  ['main.(*server).listTodos', 0, 49.19],
  ['encoding/json/v2.MarshalEncode', 0, 29.27],
  ['encoding/json/v2.makeStructArshaler.func2', 8.54, 28.86],
  ['syscall.rawsyscalln', 32.93, 32.93],
];
const f = (n: number) => n.toFixed(2) + '%';
---
<figure class="gp18c">
  <div class="gp18c-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Five rows of a real CPU profile of the Todo service. Each row has a long bar for cum, the share of samples with the function anywhere in the stack, and a gold part for flat, the share with the function on top. conn.serve has 63.01 percent cum and 0 flat. listTodos has 49.19 cum and 0 flat. makeStructArshaler.func2 has 28.86 cum and 8.54 flat. syscall.rawsyscalln has 32.93 for both.">
    <text x="20" y="24" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Wrappers have cum, workers have flat</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Hàm bọc có cum, hàm làm việc có flat</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="20" y="40" width="14" height="14" rx="3" class="cumkey" />
    <text x="40" y="52" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>cum: anywhere in the stack</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>cum: có mặt trong stack</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="290" y="40" width="14" height="14" rx="3" class="flatkey" />
    <text x="310" y="52" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>flat: on top of the stack</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>flat: nằm trên cùng stack</tspan>
    </text>

    <text x="740" y="86" text-anchor="end" class="b">flat</text>
    <text x="840" y="86" text-anchor="end" class="b">cum</text>

    {rows.map((r, i) => (
      <g>
        <text x="20" y={116 + i * 30} class="body">{r[0]}</text>
        <rect x="360" y={102 + i * 30} width={Number(r[2]) * S} height="20" rx="3" class="cum" />
        {Number(r[1]) > 0 && <rect x="360" y={102 + i * 30} width={Number(r[1]) * S} height="20" rx="3" class="flat" />}
        <text x="740" y={117 + i * 30} text-anchor="end" class="body num">{f(Number(r[1]))}</text>
        <text x="840" y={117 + i * 30} text-anchor="end" class="body num">{f(Number(r[2]))}</text>
      </g>
    ))}
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Real rows from the CPU profile captured in this post (Go 1.27.1, 2,460 ms of samples). The bar is the cum share; the gold part inside it is the flat share. syscall.rawsyscalln is all flat, so it is where the CPU is actually spent; the rows above it only hand work down.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Các dòng thật từ CPU profile capture trong bài (Go 1.27.1, 2.460 ms mẫu). Thanh dài là phần cum, phần vàng bên trong là flat. syscall.rawsyscalln toàn flat, tức CPU thật sự tiêu ở đó; các dòng phía trên chỉ chuyển việc xuống dưới.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gp18c { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gp18c-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gp18c svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 700px; height: auto; }
  .gp18c text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp18c .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp18c .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp18c .body { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp18c .m { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp18c .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gp18c .cum, .gp18c .cumkey { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp18c .flat, .gp18c .flatkey { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .gp18c figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
